The issue here is misuse of the oracle contract. The ETHUSDFEED is actually (USD/ETH) feed not (ETH/USD) feed.
So if we change this line
 addTokenToChainlinkOracle(address(0), address(840), address(ETHUSDFEED));
to this line
 addTokenToChainlinkOracle(address(840), address(0), address(ETHUSDFEED));
in the test, it won't have any issues.

